      <Docs>
        <summary>A non human readable key calculated from the ARTIST, used for searching, sorting and grouping.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>This constant was deprecated in API level 30. These keys are generated using Locale.ROOT, which means they don't reflect locale-specific sorting preferences. To apply locale-specific sorting preferences, use ContentResolver.QUERY_ARG_SQL_SORT_ORDER with COLLATE LOCALIZED, or ContentResolver.QUERY_ARG_SORT_LOCALE.</para>
          <para>A non human readable key calculated from the ARTIST, used for searching, sorting and grouping. This constant represents a column name that can be used with a ContentProvider through a ContentValues or Cursor object. The values stored in this column are Cursor#FIELD_TYPE_STRING, and are read-only and cannot be mutated.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/provider/MediaStore.Audio.ArtistColumns#ARTIST_KEY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.provider.MediaStore.Audio.ArtistColumns.ARTIST_KEY</code>.</a></format></para>
